2026-10-13T10:24:41.6304358Z                         size for all layers of one block.
2026-10-13T10:24:41.6304537Z   -n SHARD_NUMBER, --shard-number SHARD_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:24:41.6304735Z                         shard number: number of layers in layerwise mode; use
