2026-10-13T10:24:41.6305195Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:24:41.6305374Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T10:24:41.6305574Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:24:41.6306880Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
